<p class="lead">These terms apply to this website and the 100% online Food Handler Certification course offered by The High Vault Security (“we”, “us”). By creating an account or using the site, you agree to them.</p>

<h2>1. Your account</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Register with your own legal name and an email address you can access. Your name is printed on your certificate and checked against your ID at the final exam.</li>
  <li>Your account is for you alone. Don’t share it, and don’t let anyone else study, take quizzes or sit the exam for you. Signing in on a new device signs out the previous one.</li>
  <li>Keep your password private. Tell us straight away at <a href="mailto:<%= supportEmail %>"><%= supportEmail %></a> if you think someone else has used your account.</li>
  <li>You must be old enough to enter into a binding agreement where you live, or have a parent or guardian agree to these terms for you.</li>
</ul>

<h2>2. The course</h2>
<ul>
  <li>The course is delivered entirely online: chapter videos and written lessons, a quiz after each module, and a proctored final exam taken on your own computer.</li>
  <li>The course teaches food safety principles. It does not replace the laws, regulations or public health requirements that apply where you work. Always follow your local public health unit.</li>
  <li>Buying the course is covered by our <a href="/terms-of-sale">terms and conditions of sale</a> and <a href="/refunds">refund policy</a>. The exam is covered by our <a href="/exam-policy">exam and certificate policy</a>.</li>
</ul>

