<p>We work to keep the site available at all times, but it may be briefly unavailable for maintenance or for reasons outside our control. If a problem on our side interrupts your final exam, contact us with your exam reference and we’ll make it right as described in our <a href="/exam-policy">exam policy</a>.</p>

